    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n105489" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρομ-ερός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ά</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>trembling</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χεῖρες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Acut.</u>
				</span></i>
			(<u>Sp.</u>)<i><span class="en">
				23
			</span></i> (where <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				15.827
			</span></i> prefers <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρομώδης</span>)
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">; βάσις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Ph.</u>
					304
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γήρᾳ τ. γυῖα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>HF</u>
					231
				</span></i>
			; prob. so in <i><span class="en">
				Sapph.
				<u>Supp.</u>
				10.4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>trembling for fear, quaking,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Tr.</u>
				176
			</span></i> (anap.), al.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεῖμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					4.53
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>fearful,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μάστιξ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Rh.</u>
					36
				</span></i>
			 (anap.), cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>PMag.Par.</u>
				1.266
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				357
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PMag.Leid.V.</u>
				4.30
			</span></i>.</div>
